      "title": {
        "en": "dsh-superagent",
        "zh": "dsh-superagent"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A proactive agent for one GitHub repository: listens to GitHub and optionally Feishu, turns authorized requests into tickets, and executes each in its own DSH session.",
        "zh": "面向单个 GitHub 仓库的主动式智能体：监听 GitHub（可选飞书），把获得授权的请求转成工单，并在独立的 DSH 会话里执行。"
      },
